1
00:00:00,042 --> 00:00:02,472
I'm always excited for you!

2
00:00:02,478 --> 00:00:04,148
(Leonard:)I'm excited that you found
this new job

3
00:00:04,146 --> 00:00:05,716
(Leonard:)where you're making
decent money.

4
00:00:05,714 --> 00:00:07,914
(Penny:)Decent? I make twice
what you make.

5
00:00:07,916 --> 00:00:09,546
Wait, twice?!

6
00:00:09,551 --> 00:00:11,081
(Howard:)Yeah.

7
00:00:11,086 --> 00:00:14,786
Like, "times two" twice?

8
00:00:16,157 --> 00:00:17,987
(Wil:)For those of you at home,
Leonard just found out

9
00:00:17,993 --> 00:00:21,163
his fiancée makes
way more money than he does.

10
00:00:21,163 --> 00:00:23,733
(Wil:)Let's listen.

11
00:00:23,732 --> 00:00:25,662
(Leonard:)I went to school
for half my life.

12
00:00:25,667 --> 00:00:26,767
(Leonard:)I have a doctorate.

13
00:00:26,769 --> 00:00:29,339
(Leonard:)I'm still paying off
college loans.

14
00:00:29,338 --> 00:00:30,438
(Penny:)Well, how much do you owe?

15
00:00:30,439 --> 00:00:32,409
(Penny:)Maybe I can help you out.

16
00:00:34,342 --> 00:00:37,682
(Leonard:)Wil, can we just turn off
the podcast for a little bit?

17
00:00:37,679 --> 00:00:39,009
(Wil:)For those of you at home,

18
00:00:39,014 --> 00:00:41,184
I am shaking my head "no."

19
00:00:48,790 --> 00:00:50,120
(Amy:)How's it going, Sheldon?

20
00:00:50,125 --> 00:00:52,825
Wonderful!

21
00:00:53,861 --> 00:00:56,031
(Sheldon:)I just finished
hanging the lights.

22
00:00:56,031 --> 00:00:57,061
(Amy:)Can I come in?

23
00:00:57,065 --> 00:00:59,095
(Sheldon:)Yes, oh,
but enter through the side.

24
00:00:59,101 --> 00:01:06,021
(Sheldon:)Batman is
a load-bearing blanket.

